  "details": "Description\n\nRotating an item happens with middle click, same as the new hand movement. When trying to rotate an item (e.g. mirror) it moves the hand and the item is moved in an unexpected manner.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\n1. take out personal mirror\n\n2. click it to hold it in your hand\n\n3. try to rotate it with middle click\n\n4. the movement is unexpected - not rotating as expected, the old behavior\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1953-d52354d5be-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-25_15-48-33.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_f6cff2b1-58f7-43bf-b010-f19bb6077d85/1/file)",
